      "en": "But Jehoiada grew old and was full of days, and he died. He was one hundred thirty years old when he died.",
      "ko": "여호야다가 나이 많고 늙어서 죽으니 죽을 때에 일백삼십세라",
      "source_text_hash": "434fdbfd83dcbe723511987fc951f8b7680a9a0ee8b3d9d595199a54b3909bf1",
      "translation_text_hash": "c94b91fc65ed50ac0b4d0a2d587760a6093acd9f587185f2f8fc2213387a8c40",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
